{"quest_id": 7645, "name": "王子と水着", "description": "夏恒例の二国合同演習を行う王子たち。\n水着に着替えた女性陣と共に\n模擬戦に挑み、勝利を奪え！\n中級（★１獲得の目安：平均Lv1 出撃8体）", "event": "幻のシャークアイランド", "event_category": "History", "mission_id": 920179, "map_no": 4103, "level": 100, "multiplier": 1.0, "charisma": 25, "capacity": 8, "enemies": [{"enemy_id": 1, "source": "local", "count": 1, "form_index": 0, "form_count": 1, "hp": 6500, "attack": 500, "base_hp": 6500, "base_attack": 500, "damage_type": "physical", "armor_defense": 50, "magic_defense": 30, "attack_speed": 70, "attack_wait": 30, "attack_interval": 196, "move_speed": 1700.0, "gain_cost": 3, "dot_rate": 1.5, "assassin_resist": 100, "transform_resist": 100, "pattern_id": 2115168, "race_id": 16, "master_id": 31108, "global_id": 4727}, {"enemy_id": 2, "source": "local", "count": 7, "form_index": 0, "form_count": 1, "hp": 2500, "attack": 600, "base_hp": 2500, "base_attack": 600, "damage_type": "physical", "armor_defense": 200, "magic_defense": 5, "attack_speed": 70, "attack_wait": 10, "attack_interval": 160, "move_speed": 1600.0, "gain_cost": 1, "dot_rate": 1.5, "assassin_resist": 1000, "transform_resist": 1000, "pattern_id": 2097520, "race_id": 16, "master_id": 27, "global_id": 26}, {"enemy_id": 3, "source": "local", "count": 1, "form_index": 0, "form_count": 1, "hp": 14000, "attack": 250, "base_hp": 14000, "base_attack": 250, "damage_type": "physical", "armor_defense": 340, "magic_defense": 10, "attack_speed": 1, "attack_wait": 15, "attack_interval": 64, "move_speed": 500.0, "gain_cost": 3, "dot_rate": 1.5, "assassin_resist": 1, "transform_resist": 100, "pattern_id": 2123072, "race_id": 16, "special_effect_id": 528, "master_id": 32574, "global_id": 6192}, {"enemy_id": 4, "source": "local", "count": 1, "form_index": 0, "form_count": 1, "hp": 2500, "attack": 180, "base_hp": 2500, "base_attack": 180, "damage_type": "magical", "armor_defense": 10, "magic_defense": 10, "attack_range": 180, "attack_speed": 70, "attack_wait": 40, "attack_interval": 151, "move_speed": 350.0, "gain_cost": 3, "dot_rate": 1.5, "assassin_resist": 1, "transform_resist": 100, "pattern_id": 2119120, "race_id": 16, "missile_id": 7, "missile": {"speed": 6.0, "splash": 133}, "master_id": 31824, "global_id": 5443, "ranged": true}, {"enemy_id": 5, "source": "local", "count": 48, "form_index": 0, "form_count": 1, "tags": ["帝国"], "hp": 2000, "attack": 350, "base_hp": 2000, "base_attack": 350, "damage_type": "physical", "armor_defense": 150, "attack_speed": 70, "attack_wait": 10, "attack_interval": 151, "move_speed": 700.0, "gain_cost": 1, "dot_rate": 1.5, "assassin_resist": 1000, "transform_resist": 1000, "pattern_id": 2102256, "race_id": 16, "master_id": 368, "global_id": 367}, {"enemy_id": 6, "source": "local", "count": 3, "form_index": 0, "form_count": 1, "hp": 900, "attack": 150, "base_hp": 900, "base_attack": 150, "damage_type": "magical", "armor_defense": 20, "magic_defense": 5, "attack_range": 100, "attack_speed": 70, "attack_wait": 60, "attack_interval": 166, "move_speed": 500.0, "gain_cost": 1, "dot_rate": 1.5, "assassin_resist": 1000, "transform_resist": 1000, "pattern_id": 2097600, "race_id": 16, "missile_id": 8, "missile": {"speed": 6.0}, "master_id": 32, "global_id": 31, "ranged": true, "spawn_sec": 53}, {"enemy_id": 7, "source": "local", "count": 1, "form_index": 0, "form_count": 1, "hp": 3500, "attack": 450, "base_hp": 3500, "base_attack": 450, "damage_type": "physical", "armor_defense": 150, "magic_defense": 20, "attack_speed": 20, "attack_wait": 10, "attack_interval": 81, "move_speed": 500.0, "gain_cost": 3, "dot_rate": 1.5, "assassin_resist": 1, "transform_resist": 100, "pattern_id": 2131712, "race_id": 16, "master_id": 34192, "global_id": 7809, "spawn_sec": 105}, {"enemy_id": 8, "source": "local", "count": 1, "form_index": 0, "form_count": 1, "hp": 32000, "attack": 1000, "base_hp": 32000, "base_attack": 1000, "damage_type": "physical", "armor_defense": 220, "attack_speed": 20, "attack_wait": 5, "attack_interval": 82, "move_speed": 600.0, "gain_cost": 3, "dot_rate": 1.5, "assassin_resist": 1, "transform_resist": 100, "pattern_id": 2137344, "race_id": 12, "master_id": 34961, "global_id": 8578, "spawn_sec": 160}], "popups": ["レオラがいる間は、\n全ての敵ユニットの\n攻撃と防御がアップします。"], "dialogue": [{"trigger": "start", "lines": [{"name": "へカティエ", "text": "――はぁ？　オリュンポスに来いって言われた？", "face": "u1526a1"}, {"name": "アルティア", "text": "はい、亜神ディアスいわく、\n戦いたいのなら、相応しい実力を身に着けた上で、\nオリュンポスを超えて会いに来い、と。", "face": "u1524a1"}, {"name": "へカティエ", "text": "はぁ……あいつのことだから、\n嘘や虚勢じゃなくて、間違いなく本気で言ってるわね。\nまったく、道楽にも程があるってものよ。", "face": "u1526a1"}, {"name": "清源妙道真君", "text": "――道楽という意味では、\n演習の合間に思う存分遠泳していた\n亜神へカティエもなかなかに負けていないと思いますが。", "face": "u1527a1"}, {"name": "ハリナ", "text": "まったくだ。\nこれは亜神たちとの戦いを想定した、\n二国合同の海上戦闘演習なのだぞ？", "face": "u1525a1"}, {"name": "へカティエ", "text": "……それ、全員水着脱いだ上でもう一度言ってくれる？", "face": "u1526a1"}, {"name": "レオーネ", "text": "えー、だって海だよ？\n海で水着じゃないのは犯罪だよ！　犯罪！", "face": "u1523a1"}, {"name": "ヘカティエ", "text": "あなたたちの！　王子も！　水着じゃないでしょ！！", "face": "u1526a1"}, {"name": "レオーネ", "text": "あっ、ほんとだ。\nってことは……王子に水着を\n着せる大義名分を得たってこと？", "face": "u1523a1"}, {"name": "清源妙道真君", "text": "……なるほど、無理やり着替えさせるのもまた一興。", "face": "u1527a1"}, {"name": "ハリナ", "text": "季節の行事を楽しむのも為政者の責務。\nとなれば、水着姿を披露しないのは問題だな。", "face": "u1525a1"}, {"name": "アルティア", "text": "……不思議と説得力がありますね。\n元帥殿、提案なのですが――", "face": "u1524a1"}, {"name": "レオラ", "text": "――ん、何かしら？\n……ふむふむ、ふむ、ほうほうほう。", "face": "u1028a1"}, {"name": "レオラ", "text": "それ、最高ね！！\nよぉし、次の戦闘は、このメンバーで\n王子を着替えさせに掛かりましょ♪", "face": "u1028a1"}, {"name": "王子", "text": "…………！？", "face": "u1"}, {"name": "レオーネ", "text": "きゃっほー！　覚悟しろ王子ー！！\n真夏に輝く一番星にしてあげるからねー！", "face": "u1523a1"}, {"name": "アンナ", "text": "えっ、えぇと……。\nこのままでは王子が水着姿に……？\nみ、見てみた――コホンっ。", "face": "lfdc4f19dfaa3"}, {"name": "アンナ", "text": "王子、模擬戦の指揮、よろしくお願いします！"}]}, {"trigger": "end", "lines": [{"name": "レオーネ", "text": "むぅぅ、王子のガード固すぎー！！", "face": "u1523a1"}, {"name": "清源妙道真君", "text": "まったくです。\n乙女の柔肌を見ておきながら、\n自分はその肉体美をさらしたくないとは。", "face": "u1527a1"}, {"name": "ヘカティエ", "text": "……ふざけているようで、\n模擬戦には全力でとりくんでいるのが\nこの二国らしさなのかしらね。", "face": "u1526a1"}, {"name": "王子", "text": "…………。", "face": "u1"}, {"name": "レオーネ", "text": "ん、どしたの王子？", "face": "u1523a1"}, {"name": "王子", "text": "…………（くいくい）", "face": "u1"}, {"name": "レオーネ", "text": "手招き……？\nあっ、待って待って！　どこいくのさー！", "face": "u1523a1"}, {"name": "アルティア", "text": "いったいどうしたのでしょうか……。\nひとまず、ついて行ってみましょうか。", "face": "u1524a1"}]}], "map": {"image": "Map920179_4103", "w": 960, "h": 640, "spots": [{"k": "b", "x": 626, "y": 519}, {"k": "m", "x": 514, "y": 177, "id": 200}, {"k": "m", "x": 625, "y": 429, "id": 201}, {"k": "m", "x": 691, "y": 359, "id": 202}, {"k": "m", "x": 691, "y": 177, "id": 203}, {"k": "m", "x": 605, "y": 177, "id": 204}, {"k": "m", "x": 430, "y": 177, "id": 205}, {"k": "m", "x": 430, "y": 360, "id": 206}, {"k": "m", "x": 514, "y": 360, "id": 207}, {"k": "m", "x": 605, "y": 360, "id": 208}, {"k": "m", "x": 778, "y": 328, "id": 209}, {"k": "m", "x": 776, "y": 233, "id": 210}, {"k": "m", "x": 286, "y": 171, "id": 211}, {"k": "m", "x": 286, "y": 328, "id": 212}, {"k": "r", "x": 723, "y": 402, "id": 300}, {"k": "r", "x": 794, "y": 395, "id": 301}, {"k": "r", "x": 531, "y": 395, "id": 302}, {"k": "r", "x": 285, "y": 88, "id": 303}, {"k": "r", "x": 241, "y": 361, "id": 304}, {"k": "r", "x": 292, "y": 368, "id": 305}, {"k": "r", "x": 559, "y": 87, "id": 306}, {"k": "r", "x": 729, "y": 86, "id": 307}, {"k": "r", "x": 346, "y": 243, "id": 308}, {"k": "r", "x": 404, "y": 223, "id": 309}, {"k": "r", "x": 462, "y": 223, "id": 310}, {"k": "r", "x": 520, "y": 223, "id": 311}, {"k": "r", "x": 578, "y": 225, "id": 312}, {"k": "r", "x": 641, "y": 224, "id": 313}, {"k": "r", "x": 701, "y": 224, "id": 314}, {"k": "r", "x": 404, "y": 278, "id": 315}, {"k": "r", "x": 464, "y": 280, "id": 316}, {"k": "r", "x": 520, "y": 280, "id": 317}, {"k": "r", "x": 579, "y": 278, "id": 318}, {"k": "r", "x": 639, "y": 277, "id": 319}, {"k": "r", "x": 699, "y": 279, "id": 320}]}, "active": true}